        "\\(-\\frac1{x-3}\\)",
        "\\(\\frac1{x-3}\\)",
        "\\(-\\frac1{x+3}\\)",
        "\\(\\frac{x-3}{1}\\)"
      ],
      "answer": 0,
      "explanation": "Vì \\(3-x=-(x-3)\\), nên \\(\\frac1{3-x}=-\\frac1{x-3}\\)."
    },
